# Architecture

- Device-independent logic → `:core` + JUnit. If it does not need Android, do not put it in `:app` or `:android`.
- Platform IO (ONNX, mic, speaker, radio, Keystore, files) → `:android`.
- Compose / Hilt / Activity → `:app` only. Single Activity.
- `settings.gradle.kts` omits Android modules without SDK. `:core:test` must keep working.
- Room is unused. Do not add a database unless asked.
- One STT + one TTS in RAM. Unload before load. CPU ONNX only (no NNAPI/GPU).
- Packet auth is AES-256-GCM + header AAD. Do not add HMAC “because Features.md says so.”
